/*!
    \module DragonMediaBackend
    \title Dragon Media Backend C++ Classes
    \ingroup modules
    \cmakepackage DragonMediaBackend
    \cmakecomponent DragonMediaBackend

    \brief Audio playback backend for music players.

    Dragon Media Backend provides an audio playback engine with gapless
    playback, FFT visualization data, radio stream support with
    ICY metadata, and multi-backend audio output (PipeWire, PulseAudio, and
    SDL3). It is built with FFmpeg, kissfft, and C++23.

    The public API centers on \l DragonPlayer, the playback controller,
    together with \l DragonAudioOutput for output controls, \l DragonSpectrumAnalyzer
    for FFT outputs for visualization. Supporting value classes include \l DragonFftFrame
    and \l DragonIcyMetadata.
*/
